y as possible so that  we can actually avoid  fraud as far as the ticketing is  concerned and that's something that's  absolutely  essential  and we'll also  make sure there'll be a reinforcement of  public order these risky uh matches are  so the plus one doesn't relate to the  events of saturday night but those of  last night  and once again there we are absolutely  really upset to see in which uh  supporters behaved  badly so with jihad  we want to  work together sports justice home office  and we want to look at this fight  against  the supporters behaving badly in the  area of football and we want to make  sure that we are firm but at the same  time to have faith in the strength of  dialogue  and also with the national division  in the fight against hulu  but also working with the associations  of supporters we want to reactivate this  dialogue we want to reactivate these  this reflection to make sure that the  foot that we love so much  that gives rise to passions doesn't give  rise to  bad behavior thank you very much for  your attention
 

